  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have practiced new ways to use your Sneak Attack. The following effects are now among your Cunning Strike options.</p><p><strong>Invigorate (Cost: 2d6).</strong> Choose a creature you can see within 30 feet of you. Until the end of that creature's next turn, whenever it makes an attack roll or a saving throw, it can roll 1d6 and add the number rolled to the roll.</p><p><strong>Parrying Stance (Cost: 2d6).</strong> Roll 1d6. Until the start of your next turn, you gain a bonus to your AC equal to the number rolled.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-mYvovx34ejgPlZk0\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Parrying Stance: add the rolled bonus to your AC until the start of your next turn yourself.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
